<%- include('_shell_start') %><h1 class="serif" style="font-size:42px">AI Bot Knowledge</h1><p style="color:#777">এখানে আলাদা আলাদা information লিখুন। Bot এগুলো + live Turso database নিজে ব্যবহার করবে। কোনো Groq/OpenAI/Gemini API key নেই।</p><% if(message){%><div class="notice"><%= message %></div><%}%><form class="admin-card" method="post" action="/admin/ai-bot"><label class="field full"><span>Bot Behaviour / Custom Handler Instruction</span><textarea name="agent_instruction"><%= s.agent_instruction %></textarea></label><div class="admin-grid"><% for(let i=1;i<=8;i++){%><div class="admin-card" style="margin-top:0"><h3>Information <%= i %></h3><label class="field"><span>Title</span><input name="ai_q<%= i %>_title" value="<%= s['ai_q'+i+'_title'] %>"></label><label class="field" style="margin-top:10px"><span>Description / Answer</span><textarea name="ai_q<%= i %>_text"><%= s['ai_q'+i+'_text'] %></textarea></label></div><%}%></div><button class="btn-gold" style="margin-top:20px">Save Bot Knowledge</button></form><%- include('_shell_end') %>
